# Frozen contracts

- Do not change field names, units, coordinates, or endianness in `docs/interfaces.md` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not add or rename IqFrame / DetectionEvent / AoAResult / GeoFix / ChannelMap / ArrayGeometry keys on your own.
- Do not modify any file under `阵列天线/` (photos, PDFs, HFSS plots).
- Single-station output is azimuth only. `GeoFix.valid` must stay false. Never plot flyer lat/lon from one AOA.
- Default `M=4` (elements 1,3,5,7). Do not assume a second X310. Do not treat HFSS「半径 xx mm」as UCA `R_m`.

```text
# BAD: invent a field
AoAResult.pilot_lat_deg = ...

# GOOD: attach invalid GeoFix
geo_fix.valid = false
```
